<html lang="en">

<head>
  <title>AIditor — Visual Editor for Jay Stack | Jay Framework</title>
  <meta name="description"
    content="Learn how to use AIditor: live preview, point-and-shoot annotations, Add Menu, video capture, and AI agent integration for Jay Stack projects.">
  <script type="application/jay-data" contract="./page.jay-contract"></script>
  <script type="application/jay-headless" src="../../components/site-header/site-header"
    contract="../../components/site-header/site-header.jay-contract"
    template="../../components/site-header/site-header.jay-html"></script>
  <script type="application/jay-headless" src="../../components/site-footer/site-footer"
    contract="../../components/site-footer/site-footer.jay-contract"
    template="../../components/site-footer/site-footer.jay-html"></script>
  <script type="application/jay-headless" plugin="@jay-framework/ui-kit" contract="clipboard-copy"></script>
  <script type="application/jay-validations">
seo:
  no-lcp-image: true
  </script>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml"
    href="https://static.wixstatic.com/shapes/c569b3_448c7c0df8024b2786885af2054a24a8.svg">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="../../styles/theme.css">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <style>
    /* ── Page background ── */
    body {
      background: #0e1322;
      color: var(--color-text);
      font-family: var(--font-body);
      margin: 0;
    }

    /* ── Shared utilities ── */
    .aid-container {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 960px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding-left: 16px;
      padding-right: 16px;
    }

    @media (min-width: 768px) {
      .aid-container {
        padding-left: 32px;
        padding-right: 32px;
      }
    }

    .aid-section {
      padding: 48px 0;
    }

    @media (min-width: 768px) {
      .aid-section {
        padding: 80px 0;
      }
    }

    @media (min-width: 1280px) {
      .aid-section {
        padding: 96px 0;
      }
    }

    .aid-section--alt {
      background: #161b2b;
    }

    .aid-label {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 16px;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: var(--color-primary-dim);
      letter-spacing: 0.4em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .aid-text-muted {
      color: #bbc9cf;
    }

    .aid-glass {
      background: rgba(10, 15, 30, 0.7);
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
      border-radius: var(--radius-2xl);
    }

    /* ── Hero ── */
    .aid-hero {
      position: relative;
      padding: 160px 0 64px;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: #0e1322;
    }

    .aid-hero-grid {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(0, 210, 255, 0.05) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0, 210, 255, 0.05) 1px, transparent 1px);
      background-size: 40px 40px;
      opacity: 0.3;
      z-index: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .aid-hero-content {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      text-align: center;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 24px;
    }

    .aid-hero h1 {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 48px);
      line-height: 1.1;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      color: var(--color-primary);
      max-width: 800px;
    }

    /* ── Shimmer pass on hero title ── */
    @keyframes aid-shimmer-pass {
      0% {
        background-position: -150% center;
      }

      15% {
        background-position: -150% center;
      }

      35% {
        background-position: 150% center;
      }

      100% {
        background-position: 150% center;
      }
    }

    .aid-hero-title-wrap {
      position: relative;
      display: inline-block;
    }

    .aid-hero-title-shine {
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      background: linear-gradient(105deg, transparent 35%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4) 46%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7) 50%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4) 54%, transparent 65%);
      background-size: 200% auto;
      background-repeat: no-repeat;
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      background-clip: text;
      color: transparent;
      animation: aid-shimmer-pass 5s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    .aid-hero-subhead {
      font-family: var(--font-body);
      font-size: 18px;
      line-height: 28px;
      color: #bbc9cf;
      max-width: 720px;
    }

    .aid-hero-subhead strong {
      color: var(--color-text);
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .aid-hero-buttons {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 16px;
      justify-content: center;
      margin-top: 8px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 767px) {
      .aid-hero-buttons {
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: stretch;
        width: 100%;
      }

      .aid-hero-buttons>* {
        width: 100%;
        justify-content: center;
      }
    }

    .aid-btn-primary {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      background: var(--color-primary-container);
      color: var(--color-on-primary-container);
      padding: 14px 28px;
      border: none;
      border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 15px;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: box-shadow 0.3s, transform 0.2s;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .aid-btn-primary:hover {
      box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(0, 210, 255, 0.3);
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .aid-btn-primary:focus-visible {
      outline: 2px solid var(--color-primary-dim);
      outline-offset: 2px;
    }

    .aid-btn-secondary {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(165, 231, 255, 0.3);
      background: rgba(165, 231, 255, 0.05);
      color: var(--color-text);
      padding: 14px 28px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 15px;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: background 0.3s;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .aid-btn-secondary:hover {
      background: rgba(165, 231, 255, 0.1);
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .aid-btn-secondary:focus-visible {
      outline: 2px solid var(--color-primary-dim);
      outline-offset: 2px;
    }

    .aid-btn-cmd {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
    }

    .aid-copy-icon {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      opacity: 0.5;
      transition: opacity 0.2s;
    }

    .aid-btn-cmd:hover .aid-copy-icon {
      opacity: 1;
    }

    .aid-hero-micro {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 20px;
      color: #859399;
      text-align: center;
      margin-top: 8px;
    }

    /* ── Video frame ── */
    .aid-video-frame {
      position: relative;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 880px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
      border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
      border: 1px solid rgba(71, 214, 255, 0.15);
      overflow: hidden;
      background: #05070d;
      transition: box-shadow 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease;
    }

    .aid-video-frame:hover {
      border-color: rgba(71, 214, 255, 0.35);
      box-shadow: 0 0 24px rgba(0, 210, 255, 0.08);
    }

    .aid-video-frame video {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      display: block;
      object-fit: cover;
    }

    /* ── Feature section ── */
    .aid-feature-header {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }

    @media (min-width: 768px) {
      .aid-feature-header {
        margin-bottom: 48px;
      }
    }

    .aid-feature-header h2 {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 32px;
      line-height: 40px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
      color: var(--color-text);
      margin-top: 12px;
    }

    .aid-feature-header p {
      font-family: var(--font-body);
      font-size: 18px;
      line-height: 28px;
      color: #bbc9cf;
      max-width: 65ch;
      margin: 16px auto 0;
    }

    /* ── Side-by-side feature layout (text 1/3 + video 2/3) ── */
    .aid-feature-side {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 32px;
    }

    @media (min-width: 768px) {
      .aid-feature-side {
        flex-direction: row;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 48px;
      }
    }

    .aid-feature-side-text {
      flex: 1;
      min-width: 0;
    }

    .aid-feature-side-text .aid-label {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .aid-feature-side-text h2 {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 28px;
      line-height: 36px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
      color: var(--color-text);
      margin: 0 0 16px;
    }

    .aid-feature-side-text p {
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 26px;
      color: #bbc9cf;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .aid-feature-side-video {
      flex: 2;
      min-width: 0;
    }

    .aid-feature-side-video .aid-video-frame {
      max-width: none;
    }

    @media (min-width: 768px) {
      .aid-feature-side--reverse {
        flex-direction: row-reverse;
      }
    }

    /* ── Closing CTA ── */
    .aid-cta {
      position: relative;
      padding: 48px 32px;
      text-align: center;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    @media (min-width: 768px) {
      .aid-cta {
        padding: 64px 48px;
      }
    }

    .aid-cta-glow-tl,
    .aid-cta-glow-br {
      position: absolute;
      width: 240px;
      height: 240px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      filter: blur(120px);
      opacity: 0.3;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .aid-cta-glow-tl {
      top: -80px;
      /* design-system: allow */
      left: -80px;
      /* design-system: allow */
      background: rgba(0, 210, 255, 0.5);
    }

    .aid-cta-glow-br {
      bottom: -80px;
      /* design-system: allow */
      right: -80px;
      /* design-system: allow */
      background: rgba(71, 214, 255, 0.3);
    }

    .aid-cta h2 {
      position: relative;
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 40px);
      line-height: 1.2;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      color: var(--color-text);
    }

    .aid-cta p {
      position: relative;
      margin-top: 16px;
      font-size: 18px;
      line-height: 28px;
      color: #bbc9cf;
      max-width: 640px;
      margin-left: auto;
      margin-right: auto;
    }

    .aid-cta-buttons {
      position: relative;
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 16px;
      margin-top: 32px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 767px) {
      .aid-cta-buttons {
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: stretch;
      }

      .aid-cta-buttons>* {
        width: 100%;
        justify-content: center;
      }
    }

    /* ── Comparison grid ── */
    .aid-compare-section .aid-container {
      max-width: 1200px;
    }

    .aid-compare-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 24px;
    }

    @media (min-width: 768px) {
      .aid-compare-grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
        gap: 32px;
      }
    }

    .aid-compare-card {
      background: rgba(22, 30, 50, 0.9);
      /* design-system: allow */
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      border-radius: var(--radius-2xl);
      padding: 32px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 16px;
      transition: border-color 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
    }

    .aid-compare-card:hover {
      border-color: rgba(0, 210, 255, 0.3);
      box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0, 210, 255, 0.05);
    }

    .aid-compare-card h3 {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 20px;
      line-height: 28px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--color-text);
      margin: 0;
    }

    .aid-compare-card p {
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 24px;
      color: #bbc9cf;
      margin: 0;
      flex: 1;
    }

    .aid-compare-img {
      width: 100%;
      aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      overflow: hidden;
      background: #ffffff;
      padding: 6px;
      /* design-system: allow */
    }

    .aid-compare-img img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
      display: block;
      border-radius: calc(var(--radius-lg) - 6px);
      /* design-system: allow */
    }

    .aid-compare-verdict {
      font-family: var(--font-body);
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 20px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--color-tertiary-container);
    }

    /* ── Intent layout: video 2/3 + tabs 1/3 ── */
    .aid-intent-section .aid-container {
      max-width: 1200px;
    }

    .aid-intent-layout {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 32px;
    }

    @media (min-width: 768px) {
      .aid-intent-layout {
        flex-direction: row;
        gap: 32px;
        align-items: stretch;
      }
    }

    .aid-intent-layout .aid-video-frame {
      flex: 2;
      min-width: 0;
      aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
    }

    .aid-intent-tabs {
      flex: 1;
      min-width: 0;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .aid-intent-tabs input[type="radio"] {
      display: none;
    }

    .aid-tab-bar {
      display: flex;
      gap: 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }

    .aid-tab-label {
      flex: 1;
      cursor: pointer;
      padding: 12px 8px;
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 18px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #859399;
      text-align: center;
      border-bottom: 2px solid transparent;
      transition: color 0.2s, border-color 0.2s;
      margin-bottom: -1px;
      /* design-system: allow */
    }

    .aid-tab-label:hover {
      color: var(--color-text);
    }

    #aid-tab-canvas:checked~.aid-tab-bar label[for="aid-tab-canvas"],
    #aid-tab-design:checked~.aid-tab-bar label[for="aid-tab-design"],
    #aid-tab-vision:checked~.aid-tab-bar label[for="aid-tab-vision"] {
      color: var(--color-text);
      border-bottom-color: var(--color-primary);
    }

    .aid-tab-panels {
      flex: 1;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .aid-tab-panel {
      display: none;
      padding: 24px 0;
      flex: 1;
    }

    #aid-tab-canvas:checked~.aid-tab-panels #aid-panel-canvas {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: flex-start;
    }

    #aid-tab-design:checked~.aid-tab-panels #aid-panel-design {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: flex-start;
    }

    #aid-tab-vision:checked~.aid-tab-panels #aid-panel-vision {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: flex-start;
    }

    .aid-tab-panel h3 {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 18px;
      line-height: 24px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--color-text);
      margin: 0 0 12px;
    }

    .aid-tab-panel p {
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 24px;
      color: #bbc9cf;
      margin: 0;
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      .aid-video-frame {
        transition: none;
      }

      .aid-video-frame:hover {
        box-shadow: none;
      }
    }

    @scope (.siteHeader) {

      /* ── Header ── */
      .site-header {
        position: fixed;
        top: 0;
        left: 0;
        right: 0;
        z-index: 50;
        background: rgba(14, 19, 34, 0.7);
        backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(60, 73, 78, 0.2);
      }

      .header-inner {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        max-width: var(--max-width);
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 16px var(--margin-mobile);
      }

      @media (min-width: 1024px) {
        .header-inner {
          padding: 16px var(--margin-desktop);
        }
      }

      @keyframes brand-shimmer {
        0% {
          background-position: -200% center;
        }

        100% {
          background-position: 400% center;
        }
      }

      .header-brand {
        position: relative;
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 10px;
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: 32px;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: -0.01em;
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      .brand-icon {
        width: 32px;
        height: 32px;
        flex-shrink: 0;
      }

      .brand-text-wrap {
        position: relative;
        display: inline-block;
      }

      .header-brand .brand-base {
        color: var(--color-primary);
      }

      .header-brand .brand-shine {
        position: absolute;
        top: 0;
        left: 0;
        background: linear-gradient(105deg, transparent 40%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85) 45%, rgba(165, 231, 255, 0.9) 50%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85) 55%, transparent 60%);
        background-size: 300% auto;
        background-repeat: no-repeat;
        -webkit-background-clip: text;
        background-clip: text;
        color: transparent;
        animation: brand-shimmer 5s linear infinite;
      }

      .header-nav {
        display: none;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 32px;
      }

      @media (min-width: 1024px) {
        .header-nav {
          display: flex;
        }
      }

      .header-nav a {
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: 500;
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
        text-decoration: none;
        transition: color 0.3s;
      }

      .header-nav a:hover {
        color: var(--color-primary);
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      .header-actions {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 16px;
      }

      .btn-get-started {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
        background: var(--color-primary-container);
        color: var(--color-on-primary-container);
        padding: 8px 24px;
        border: none;
        border-radius: var(--radius-default);
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: 700;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      .btn-get-started:hover {
        transform: scale(1.05);
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      /* Hide Get Started + GitHub on mobile, show hamburger */
      .header-actions .btn-get-started {
        display: none;
      }

      .header-actions .header-github {
        display: none;
        align-items: center;
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
        transition: color 0.3s;
      }

      /* Hamburger button */
      .hamburger-toggle {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        width: 40px;
        height: 40px;
        background: none;
        border: 1px solid rgba(165, 231, 255, 0.2);
        border-radius: var(--radius-default);
        cursor: pointer;
        color: var(--color-text);
        padding: 0;
      }

      .hamburger-icon {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 4px;
        width: 18px;
      }

      .hamburger-icon span {
        display: block;
        height: 2px;
        background: currentColor;
        border-radius: 1px;
        /* design-system: allow */
        transition: transform 0.3s, opacity 0.3s;
      }

      /* Mobile menu */
      #mobile-menu-toggle {
        display: none;
      }

      .mobile-menu {
        display: none;
        position: fixed;
        top: 0;
        left: 0;
        right: 0;
        bottom: 0;
        z-index: 49;
        background: var(--color-surface-lowest, #0a0f1e);
        padding: 80px var(--margin-mobile) 32px;
        /* design-system: allow */
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 8px;
        overflow-y: auto;
      }

      #mobile-menu-toggle:checked~.site-header .hamburger-icon span:nth-child(1) {
        transform: translateY(6px) rotate(45deg);
      }

      #mobile-menu-toggle:checked~.site-header .hamburger-icon span:nth-child(2) {
        opacity: 0;
      }

      #mobile-menu-toggle:checked~.site-header .hamburger-icon span:nth-child(3) {
        transform: translateY(-6px) rotate(-45deg);
      }

      #mobile-menu-toggle:checked~.mobile-menu {
        display: flex;
      }

      .mobile-menu a {
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: 18px;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
        text-decoration: none;
        padding: 12px 0;
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(60, 73, 78, 0.2);
        transition: color 0.3s;
      }

      .mobile-menu a:hover {
        color: var(--color-primary);
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      .mobile-menu .mobile-menu-actions {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 16px;
        margin-top: 24px;
      }

      .mobile-menu .mobile-menu-github {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 14px;
      }

      .mobile-menu .mobile-menu-github svg {
        flex-shrink: 0;
      }

      @media (min-width: 1024px) {
        .header-actions .btn-get-started {
          display: inline-flex;
        }

        .header-actions .header-github {
          display: flex;
        }

        .hamburger-toggle {
          display: none;
        }

        .mobile-menu {
          display: none !important;
        }
      }
    }

    @scope (.siteFooter) {

      /* ── Footer ── */
      .site-footer {
        background: var(--color-surface-lowest);
        border-top: 1px solid rgba(60, 73, 78, 0.2);
        padding: 48px 0;
      }

      .footer-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: var(--space-gutter);
      }

      @media (min-width: 768px) {
        .footer-grid {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        }
      }

      @media (min-width: 1024px) {
        .footer-grid {
          grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 2fr;
        }
      }

      .footer-brand {
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: 24px;
        font-weight: 800;
        color: var(--color-primary);
        margin-bottom: 24px;
      }

      .footer-copyright {
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 12px;
        line-height: 16px;
      }

      .footer-heading {
        color: var(--color-primary);
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: 700;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.15em;
        margin-bottom: 24px;
      }

      .footer-links {
        list-style: none;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 12px;
      }

      .footer-links a {
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 12px;
        transition: color 0.3s;
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      .footer-links a:hover {
        color: var(--color-secondary-dim);
        text-decoration: none;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <div class="aiditor-intro-root"><jay:site-header ref="siteHeader">
      <div class="site-header-root"><input type="checkbox" id="mobile-menu-toggle">
        <header class="site-header">
          <nav class="header-inner"><a href="/" class="header-brand" aria-label="Jay Framework"><img
                src="https://static.wixstatic.com/shapes/c569b3_448c7c0df8024b2786885af2054a24a8.svg"
                alt="" class="brand-icon" width="32" height="32" loading="eager"><span
                class="brand-text-wrap" aria-hidden="true"><span class="brand-base">Jay
                  Framework</span><span class="brand-shine" aria-hidden="true">Jay
                  Framework</span></span></a>
            <div class="header-nav" override="children"><span>AIditor</span><a
                href="/ecosystem">Ecosystem</a><a href="/docs">Documentation</a><a
                href="/design-log">Design Log</a></div>
            <div class="header-actions"><a class="header-github"
                href="https://github.com/jay-framework/jay/" target="_blank"
                aria-label="GitHub"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20"
                  viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <g fill="currentColor">
                    <path
                      d="M12 0c-6.626 0-12 5.373-12 12 0 5.302 3.438 9.8 8.207 11.387.599.111.793-.261.793-.577v-2.234c-3.338.726-4.033-1.416-4.033-1.416-.546-1.387-1.333-1.756-1.333-1.756-1.089-.745.083-.729.083-.729 1.205.084 1.839 1.237 1.839 1.237 1.07 1.834 2.807 1.304 3.492.997.107-.775.418-1.305.762-1.604-2.665-.305-5.467-1.334-5.467-5.931 0-1.311.469-2.381 1.236-3.221-.124-.303-.535-1.524.117-3.176 0 0 1.008-.322 3.301 1.23.957-.266 1.983-.399 3.003-.404 1.02.005 2.047.138 3.006.404 2.291-1.552 3.297-1.23 3.297-1.23.653 1.653.242 2.874.118 3.176.77.84 1.235 1.911 1.235 3.221 0 4.609-2.807 5.624-5.479 5.921.43.372.823 1.102.823 2.222v3.293c0 .319.192.694.801.576 4.765-1.589 8.199-6.086 8.199-11.386 0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12z">
                    </path>
                  </g>
                </svg></a><a class="btn-get-started" href="/get-started">Get Started</a><label
                for="mobile-menu-toggle" class="hamburger-toggle" aria-label="Menu">
                <div class="hamburger-icon"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
              </label></div>
          </nav>
        </header>
        <div class="mobile-menu" override="children"><span>AIditor</span><a
            href="/ecosystem"
            onclick="document.getElementById('mobile-menu-toggle').checked=false">Ecosystem</a><a
            href="/docs"
            onclick="document.getElementById('mobile-menu-toggle').checked=false">Documentation</a><a
            href="/design-log">Design Log</a>
          <div class="mobile-menu-actions"><a class="mobile-menu-github"
              href="https://github.com/jay-framework/jay/" target="_blank"><svg
                xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <g fill="currentColor">
                  <path
                    d="M12 0c-6.626 0-12 5.373-12 12 0 5.302 3.438 9.8 8.207 11.387.599.111.793-.261.793-.577v-2.234c-3.338.726-4.033-1.416-4.033-1.416-.546-1.387-1.333-1.756-1.333-1.756-1.089-.745.083-.729.083-.729 1.205.084 1.839 1.237 1.839 1.237 1.07 1.834 2.807 1.304 3.492.997.107-.775.418-1.305.762-1.604-2.665-.305-5.467-1.334-5.467-5.931 0-1.311.469-2.381 1.236-3.221-.124-.303-.535-1.524.117-3.176 0 0 1.008-.322 3.301 1.23.957-.266 1.983-.399 3.003-.404 1.02.005 2.047.138 3.006.404 2.291-1.552 3.297-1.23 3.297-1.23.653 1.653.242 2.874.118 3.176.77.84 1.235 1.911 1.235 3.221 0 4.609-2.807 5.624-5.479 5.921.43.372.823 1.102.823 2.222v3.293c0 .319.192.694.801.576 4.765-1.589 8.199-6.086 8.199-11.386 0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12z">
                  </path>
                </g>
              </svg> GitHub</a><a class="btn-get-started" href="/get-started"
              onclick="document.getElementById('mobile-menu-toggle').checked=false"
              style="text-align: center; justify-content: center;">Get Started</a></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </jay:site-header>
    <main>
      <section class="aid-hero">
        <div class="aid-hero-grid"></div>
        <div class="aid-container">
          <div class="aid-hero-content"><span class="aid-label">The first visual-intent web
              editor</span>
            <h1><span class="aid-hero-title-wrap"><span class="aid-hero-title-base">Build &amp; Edit
                  Websites by Intent. Visually.</span><span class="aid-hero-title-shine"
                  aria-hidden="true">Build &amp; Edit Websites by Intent. Visually.</span></span>
            </h1>
            <p class="aid-hero-subhead">Describe your vision directly on canvas—just like giving
              natural feedback to a designer—and let the AI agent craft the content, layout, and
              animations to bring it to life. Enjoy complete creative freedom with zero constraints
              from complex panels or blind text prompts.</p>
            <div class="aid-hero-buttons"><a class="aid-btn-primary" href="/get-started">Get
                Started</a><jay:clipboard-copy text="npm create jay@latest"><button ref="copyBtn"
                  class="aid-btn-secondary aid-btn-cmd copy-tooltip-anchor"><span>npm create
                    jay@latest</span><span if="!copied" class="aid-copy-icon"
                    aria-label="Copy to clipboard"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                      width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                      stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                      <rect x="9" y="9" width="13" height="13" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
                      <path d="M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1"></path>
                    </svg></span><span if="copied" class="aid-copy-icon"><svg
                      xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                      fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"
                      stroke-linejoin="round">
                      <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
                    </svg></span><span if="copied" class="copy-tooltip" role="status"
                    aria-live="polite">Copied!</span></button></jay:clipboard-copy></div>
            <p class="aid-hero-micro">Run dev server and open <code
                style="font-family: var(--font-mono); color: var(--color-primary);">/aiditor</code>to
              start</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="aid-section aid-section--alt aid-compare-section">
        <div class="aid-container">
          <div class="aid-feature-header">
            <h2>Why Traditional Web Builders Fall Short</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="aid-compare-grid">
            <div class="aid-compare-card">
              <div class="aid-compare-img"><img
                  src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c569b3_34e60607480940c98e789edd424a843f~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_400,h_300/file.webp"
                  srcset="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c569b3_34e60607480940c98e789edd424a843f~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_300%2Ch_225/file.webp 300w, https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c569b3_34e60607480940c98e789edd424a843f~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_400%2Ch_300/file.webp 400w, https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c569b3_34e60607480940c98e789edd424a843f~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_600%2Ch_450/file.webp 600w"
                  sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 33vw"
                  alt="Selection-based editor interface with complex panels and nested layers"
                  loading="lazy"></div>
              <h3>Selection-Based Editors</h3>
              <p>Requires clicking through complex panels, endless nested layers, and manual CSS
                tweaks for every minor change.</p><span class="aid-compare-verdict">❌ High friction,
                slow iteration</span>
            </div>
            <div class="aid-compare-card">
              <div class="aid-compare-img"><img
                  src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c569b3_99533ac6727449f7b8b642ef00f6f703~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_400,h_300/file.webp"
                  srcset="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c569b3_99533ac6727449f7b8b642ef00f6f703~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_300%2Ch_225/file.webp 300w, https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c569b3_99533ac6727449f7b8b642ef00f6f703~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_400%2Ch_300/file.webp 400w, https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c569b3_99533ac6727449f7b8b642ef00f6f703~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_600%2Ch_450/file.webp 600w"
                  sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 33vw"
                  alt="Non-visual AI agent chat panel with imprecise results" loading="lazy"></div>
              <h3>Non-Visual AI Agents</h3>
              <p>Prompting in a side-panel chat makes it difficult to pinpoint specific visual
                elements or fine-tune micro-interactions like animations and transitions.</p><span
                class="aid-compare-verdict">❌ Imprecise, low visual control</span>
            </div>
            <div class="aid-compare-card">
              <div class="aid-compare-img"><img
                  src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c569b3_04aec6d1c2834b0581080687bee0891d~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_400,h_300/file.webp"
                  srcset="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c569b3_04aec6d1c2834b0581080687bee0891d~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_300%2Ch_225/file.webp 300w, https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c569b3_04aec6d1c2834b0581080687bee0891d~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_400%2Ch_300/file.webp 400w, https://static.wixstatic.com/media/c569b3_04aec6d1c2834b0581080687bee0891d~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_600%2Ch_450/file.webp 600w"
                  sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 33vw"
                  alt="CMS content editing split with custom code development" loading="lazy"></div>
              <h3>CMS &amp; Custom Code</h3>
              <p>Decouples the content from the design. Requires heavy development overhead for UI
                updates and limits creative freedom.</p><span class="aid-compare-verdict">❌ Rigid,
                engineer-dependent</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="aid-section aid-intent-section">
        <div class="aid-container">
          <div class="aid-feature-header">
            <h2>Intent-Driven Intelligence Meets Canvas Precision</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="aid-intent-layout">
            <div class="aid-video-frame"><video src="/videos/aiditor-intro/full-movie-fast.mp4"
                aria-label="Demo: AIditor fast-forward overview clip showing all editor workflows in action"
                muted playsinline controls loop autoplay preload="metadata" loading="lazy"></video>
            </div>
            <div class="aid-intent-tabs"><input type="radio" name="aid-tab" id="aid-tab-canvas"
                checked><input type="radio" name="aid-tab" id="aid-tab-design"><input type="radio"
                name="aid-tab" id="aid-tab-vision">
              <nav class="aid-tab-bar" role="tablist"><label for="aid-tab-canvas"
                  class="aid-tab-label" role="tab">On-Canvas</label><label for="aid-tab-design"
                  class="aid-tab-label" role="tab">Design &amp; Motion</label><label
                  for="aid-tab-vision" class="aid-tab-label" role="tab">Visual Context</label></nav>
              <div class="aid-tab-panels">
                <div class="aid-tab-panel" id="aid-panel-canvas" role="tabpanel">
                  <h3>Direct On-Canvas Context</h3>
                  <p>Point at any section, element, or interaction directly on the page. No need to
                    describe where things are in a text chat — AIditor sees exactly what you see and
                    sends full visual context to your agent.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="aid-tab-panel" id="aid-panel-design" role="tabpanel">
                  <h3>Design System &amp; Animations</h3>
                  <p>Request design tokens, hover effects, scroll animations, and transitions by
                    dragging from the Add menu or typing an @mention. Every request carries
                    ready-made agent context so changes follow your project's design language
                    automatically.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="aid-tab-panel" id="aid-panel-vision" role="tabpanel">
                  <h3>An Agent That Actually Sees Your Screen</h3>
                  <p>Aiditor pairs natural conversation with real-time visual perception. Your agent
                    doesn't just read your prompt—it sees your screen, understands the layout in
                    context, and applies changes with pixel-level precision.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="aid-section aid-section--alt">
        <div class="aid-container">
          <div class="aid-feature-side">
            <div class="aid-feature-side-text"><span class="aid-label">01 · Welcome</span>
              <h2>What is AIditor?</h2>
              <p>AIditor is the visual editor for Jay Stack. Open your project, preview any page
                live, annotate on the canvas, and send change requests to your AI agent.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="aid-feature-side-video">
              <div class="aid-video-frame"><video src="/videos/aiditor-intro/welcome-aiditor-2.mp4"
                  aria-label="Demo: What is AIditor — orientation tour" muted playsinline controls
                  loop preload="metadata" loading="lazy"></video></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="aid-section">
        <div class="aid-container">
          <div class="aid-feature-side aid-feature-side--reverse">
            <div class="aid-feature-side-text"><span class="aid-label">02 · Live preview</span>
              <h2>Every page, live in the editor</h2>
              <p>Your whole project runs inside AIditor. Switch routes from the Pages panel — what
                you see is the real site, not a mockup.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="aid-feature-side-video">
              <div class="aid-video-frame"><video src="/videos/aiditor-intro/live-preview-pages.mp4"
                  aria-label="Demo: switching routes in the live preview" muted playsinline controls
                  loop preload="metadata" loading="lazy"></video></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="aid-section aid-section--alt">
        <div class="aid-container">
          <div class="aid-feature-side">
            <div class="aid-feature-side-text"><span class="aid-label">03 · By intent</span>
              <h2>Point, describe, done</h2>
              <p>Click what you want to change and write a short instruction. AIditor captures
                context and screenshots so your agent knows exactly what you mean.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="aid-feature-side-video">
              <div class="aid-video-frame"><video src="/videos/aiditor-intro/change-request-1.mp4"
                  aria-label="Demo: point and shoot annotation — placing the first pin comment"
                  muted playsinline controls loop preload="metadata" loading="lazy"></video></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="aid-section">
        <div class="aid-container">
          <div class="aid-feature-side aid-feature-side--reverse">
            <div class="aid-feature-side-text"><span class="aid-label">04 · Multi-pin</span>
              <h2>Add more pins before you send</h2>
              <p>Keep annotating — place another pin on a different element and write a second
                instruction. AIditor collects every marker so you can send several changes in one
                request.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="aid-feature-side-video">
              <div class="aid-video-frame"><video src="/videos/aiditor-intro/change-request-2.mp4"
                  aria-label="Demo: stacking multiple pin comments before sending" muted playsinline
                  controls loop preload="metadata" loading="lazy"></video></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="aid-section aid-section--alt">
        <div class="aid-container">
          <div class="aid-feature-side">
            <div class="aid-feature-side-text"><span class="aid-label">05 · Send to agent</span>
              <h2>Send to your agent</h2>
              <p>When your annotations are ready, send them all at once. Your agent reads every
                marker, screenshot, and instruction — then implements the changes in code. Watch the
                preview update when the agent finishes.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="aid-feature-side-video">
              <div class="aid-video-frame"><video src="/videos/aiditor-intro/send-to-agent.mp4"
                  aria-label="Demo: sending annotations to the AI agent and viewing the result"
                  muted playsinline controls loop preload="metadata" loading="lazy"></video></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="aid-section">
        <div class="aid-container">
          <div class="aid-feature-side aid-feature-side--reverse">
            <div class="aid-feature-side-text"><span class="aid-label">06 · Add menu</span>
              <h2>Drag from the catalog</h2>
              <p>The <strong>+ Add</strong> menu lists ready-made change requests packaged by Jay
                plugins integrated with AIditor — each item is an instruction for your agent. Drag
                one onto the page to start a request.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="aid-feature-side-video">
              <div class="aid-video-frame"><video src="/videos/aiditor-intro/add-menu-request.mp4"
                  aria-label="Demo: dragging a change request from the Add Menu onto the page" muted
                  playsinline controls loop preload="metadata" loading="lazy"></video></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="aid-section aid-section--alt">
        <div class="aid-container">
          <div class="aid-feature-side">
            <div class="aid-feature-side-text"><span class="aid-label">07 · @ mentions</span>
              <h2>@ Autocomplete</h2>
              <p>Type <code
                  style="font-family: var(--font-mono); color: var(--color-primary);">@</code>in any
                instruction to open autocomplete. It lists every <strong>+ Add</strong> menu item
                and more — non-visual references plugins choose to expose, like e-commerce
                categories or page routes. When you select an item, your agent gets ready-made
                change context for that choice.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="aid-feature-side-video">
              <div class="aid-video-frame"><video src="/videos/aiditor-intro/auto-complete.mp4"
                  aria-label="Demo: @ autocomplete for Add Menu items, routes, and plugin context"
                  muted playsinline controls loop preload="metadata" loading="lazy"></video></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="aid-section">
        <div class="aid-container">
          <div class="aid-feature-side aid-feature-side--reverse">
            <div class="aid-feature-side-text"><span class="aid-label">08 · Recording</span>
              <h2>Capture motion and hover states</h2>
              <p>Hover states, motion, and animations do not show up in a still screenshot.
                Hit<strong>REC</strong>, interact with the page, then pin and annotate the moments
                that matter.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="aid-feature-side-video">
              <div class="aid-video-frame"><video src="/videos/aiditor-intro/capture-video.mp4"
                  aria-label="Demo: recording page interactions with the REC button" muted
                  playsinline controls loop preload="metadata" loading="lazy"></video></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="aid-section aid-section--alt">
        <div class="aid-container">
          <div class="aid-feature-side">
            <div class="aid-feature-side-text"><span class="aid-label">09 · Record to ship</span>
              <h2>From recording to implementation</h2>
              <p>Scrub the timeline, add pins at key frames, and leave notes at any timestamp. Send
                the recording with your annotations — your agent reads the video plus context at
                every moment you mark, implements the change, and the preview updates with the
                result.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="aid-feature-side-video">
              <div class="aid-video-frame"><video
                  src="/videos/aiditor-intro/video-preview-commenting-agent.mp4"
                  aria-label="Demo: commenting on a video capture, sending to the agent, and seeing the applied result"
                  muted playsinline controls loop preload="metadata" loading="lazy"></video></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="aid-section">
        <div class="aid-container">
          <div class="aid-glass aid-cta">
            <div class="aid-cta-glow-tl"></div>
            <div class="aid-cta-glow-br"></div>
            <h2>Start building with AIditor</h2>
            <p>Install the plugin in any Jay project, run the dev server, and open<code
                style="font-family: var(--font-mono); color: var(--color-primary);">/aiditor</code>.
              Your agent does the coding — you point and describe.</p>
            <div class="aid-cta-buttons"><a class="aid-btn-primary" href="/get-started">Get
                Started</a><jay:clipboard-copy text="npm create jay@latest"><button ref="copyBtn"
                  class="aid-btn-secondary aid-btn-cmd copy-tooltip-anchor"><span>npm create
                    jay@latest</span><span if="!copied" class="aid-copy-icon"
                    aria-label="Copy to clipboard"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                      width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                      stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                      <rect x="9" y="9" width="13" height="13" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
                      <path d="M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1"></path>
                    </svg></span><span if="copied" class="aid-copy-icon"><svg
                      xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                      fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"
                      stroke-linejoin="round">
                      <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
                    </svg></span><span if="copied" class="copy-tooltip" role="status"
                    aria-live="polite">Copied!</span></button></jay:clipboard-copy></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main><jay:site-footer ref="siteFooter">
      <footer class="site-footer">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="footer-grid">
            <div>
              <div class="footer-brand">Jay Framework</div>
              <p class="footer-copyright">Built with Jay Stack. The self-correcting visual ecosystem
                for AI-native web development.</p>
